0..72 Comment "/// `refinedPred` and `occupied` case on a lambda\'s binder whose type an"
73..115 Comment "/// enclosing case refined to a data type."
116..119 Comment "///"
120..200 Comment "/// Under the arm `Zero`, the binder\'s type `natOr(Zero)` is a call that returns"
201..245 Comment "/// `Nat`, so the case is a case over `Nat`."
246..319 Comment "/// Under the arm `ListL(a)`, the decoder\'s call returns a list type, and"
320..339 Comment "/// the same holds."
340..404 Comment "/// The kernel admits both declarations as the checker does, and"
405..427 Comment "/// both fixtures run."
428..431 Comment "///"
432..500 Comment "/// The checker unfolds the binder\'s type to the data type before it"
501..520 Comment "/// reads the case."
521..600 Comment "/// The kernel reads the decode of the returned call by its own evaluator, with"
601..671 Comment "/// every definition unfolding, before it reads the scrutinee\'s shape."
672..675 Comment "///"
676..692 Comment "/// - see: #2872"
693..739 Comment "/// - see: `../universe/decoded-descent.gandr`"
